{"synopsis":"I-an dan Muyeol dikenal di kalangan teman-temannya sebagai pasangan yang penuh kasih sayang. Pada peringatan pernikahan ke-9 mereka, Muyeol memberi I-an sebuah gedung di Cheongdam-dong untuk memperluas galerinya. Mereka menghabiskan malam yang lebih penuh gairah dari biasanya, dan sepertinya itu adalah peringatan pernikahan yang sempurna… Hingga Muyeol diam-diam keluar untuk menemui selingkuhannya.","alternative_title":"나의 바람은 죄가 아니다","author":"Jinja","artist":"So Hwi","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"a3eccc99-cbeb-4d05-b9eb-caf1689e96bc","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_57/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"7f0a285f-2643-492f-a97c-47dae3899aea","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2026-07-10","released":"2026-07-10","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_56/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_4bc52056-7f55-41c2-9001-d5baf439a636/chapter_ch_56/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/cha